<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-21T11:30:01.958Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen wounded former Super Eagles captain Segun Odegbami during a machete attack at his Abeokuta home, while security personnel continued to be targeted, with a university guard killed while returning home with his wife, another guard shot dead, and a herder shot dead in Plateau. Armed men also attacked a mining site in Plateau, leaving three feared dead. Rev. Ezekiel Dachomo mourned residents and a soldier killed in the latest Plateau attack. Police have launched a manhunt for the assailants of Odegbami and vowed to apprehend them. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPeGpNeEVrYzItU3N1X0VOSnBjMm9CTnlhTnkxd24xcGRJU3NBM243VGZEdFIwcFN5bU1VMy1jc3pHNDQ0aHRtQTB0MTF6ZDdxb2QyeHpFRlZKT2xFTEFtUDBicC1oODFPajc2NVI0TVdfd3YzSmpoYl9kM3hhVlhoa01qak5FczJvX000Z1ZhU2d4SzFILTRjTVZTMmNKTFJHQXY5UFk4d1I1YnI3emdwX3A3M3g4QlRMVEZmb0JR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPanlXYnloM2w5bmVmcUpocy02SWJuYUxyWnNGbmVFZURIR0NjU3dfOVpXdHBKUDVpdUlMdDRRYlpKZFNCd0tPZUdzaEpoMXZFZ2pKOFJySTl3MC1SeGFMZnZjdzJjWnJfZXFQTkNWX2NyUTBRc1JwWVc4S0lyazFwYVRQRzRSVWU1SUJZT1k5eDhQM1hQdy1PNVlnQmRsaV9QTEVkWVg3Z3FvbFVmajRMeHkxNTk2eExaRDlPZGJpaFFnMzdSWnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQRHRJMUNyTUZqR0F5MWJ6MmxISlI0TF9Cd09DOV9iWXBwdnplVVc2cWtpMWhyOXhKcHd6WXh0Q2hURENza1BvZjJtMjJwSTVlOHdPUVVTNmNGSzdodGo1dmVfQ3lTajh2ZmV1NjY0SjdDNnVRS3Brdmg3NHA5cmY5RTlOVjNpQlczMkg0R1J1b05MczNIWXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigeria Info FM&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQbjdGZlkzUGlFejhPM0dLd0hYXzJVYk1EZ25RRU00VDhmZjh1dm1RdHJtbzVrMmJVNkhnV1oteDFmTTNzMllTRFREb28tM3dXN1J1aWp4S1dSc0gzRnhzbUJjb